OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FGrey skies at first for many
OL,6,Fareas with outbreaks of drizzle. Skies
OL,7,Fbrightening in the south this
OL,8,Fafternoon and turning rather warm.
OL,9,FWinds strengthening with gales in the
OL,10,Fwest by the afternoon. Heavy rain in
OL,11,Fthe west later.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FHeavy rain moves east across
OL,14,Fthe UK overnight. Coastal gales
OL,15,Fcontinue in the west, but gradually
OL,16,Fease in the early hours. Patchy rain
OL,17,Fin the south and rather mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
