OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FRain moves east in the
OL,6,Fmorning, clearing in the afternoon.
OL,7,FSunny spells and heavy showers follow
OL,8,Fin the west. Windy but rather warm in
OL,9,Fthe east.
